              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2643' id='404' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='10095'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b00f53' fontsize='14'>By Vendor</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b00f53'>Æ </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>Active vendor count in competitors report (from competitive intelligence vendors denormalised table) may be different from salesforce report (from salesforce tables) due to different data sources. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The last four columns regarding Commission, GFV, mark-up value and mark-up % of menu are averaged among the vendors with mark-up against competitors only</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The column &quot;Vendors with Mark-up&quot; has taken into account the mapping accuracy (%) for each individual country.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1548' id='644' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='3595'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>Disclaimer: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>Mapping accuracy is not 100% yet, and is constantly being improved at product level for a better representation of actual mark-up vs competitors. The mark-up numbers in this report are meant to potentially size the problem, and true platform mark-ups may vary at a small margin (+/-) from numbers presented in this report.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2452' id='403' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='46429'>
