                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b00f53' fontsize='15'>By Product</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b00f53'>Æ </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>Products with mark-up (on foodpanda) in this report uses the same mark-up logic as &apos;Mark-up products vs competitors&apos; report. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The column &quot;Products with Markup&quot; has taken into account the mapping accuracy (%) for each individual country.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
